  m_Name: Evento_ReforcoDaCoesaoComunitaria
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Refor\xE7o da Coes\xE3o Comunit\xE1ria"
  _titleEn: Stronger Community Ties
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Associa\xE7\xF5es de bairro e redes de vizinhos criam capital social:
    confian\xE7a e ajuda m\xFAtua que tornam a comunidade mais segura e resistente."
  _summaryEn: 'Neighborhood associations and networks build social capital: trust
    and mutual aid that make the community safer and more resilient.'
  _realWorld: "O cientista pol\xEDtico Robert Putnam mostrou em Bowling Alone, de
    2000, que a queda da participa\xE7\xE3o em associa\xE7\xF5es nos Estados Unidos
    veio junto com a perda de confian\xE7a entre vizinhos."
  _realWorldEn: Political scientist Robert Putnam showed in Bowling Alone, from 2000,
    that falling participation in associations in the United States came along with
    declining trust between neighbors.
  _tradeOffs: "Coes\xE3o n\xE3o se decreta; o governo pode apoiar, mas depende da
    iniciativa dos moradores."
  _tradeOffsEn: Cohesion cannot be decreed; government can support it, but it depends
    on residents' initiative.
  _sources:
  - Label: Bowling Alone (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bowling_Alone
